- Up to and including termination of employment.
- Demotion.
- Withholding increment or promotion.
- Legal action as appropriate.
- Other actions deemed appropriate by service rules.

The HR department, under the directions of the Internal Committee, will conduct and document disciplinary action while maintaining confidentiality (section 12.2).

